#: rc.cpp:40
msgid "Change keyboard layout."
msgstr "Promijeni raspored tastature."

#: rc.cpp:41
msgid ""
"Here you can change the keyboard layout. If you are from Germany you want to "
"choose 'de'."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete promijeniti raspored tastature. Ako ste iz Njemačke, izaberite opciju "
"'de'."

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "Show only keypad"
msgstr "Prikaži samo tastaturu"

#: ktouch.cpp:128 rc.cpp:43
msgid "Training"
msgstr "Treniranje"

#: rc.cpp:48
msgid "Level up/down limits"
msgstr "Gornja/donja granica nivoa"

#: rc.cpp:49
msgid ""
"When touch-typing the levels will go up if you are typing faster than the "
"\"Limit Up\", and it will go down if you type slower than the \"Limit Down"
"\". Enable automatic adjustment by ticking the \"Automatic level adjustment\""
msgstr ""
"Kada tipkate, nivo će se povećati ako kucate brže od \"Gornje granice\", "
"a spustiti ako kucate sporije od \"Donje granice\". Automatsko prilagođavanje "
"uključite tako što ćete izabrati \"Automatsko prilagođavanje nivoa\"."

#: rc.cpp:50
msgid "Automatic level adjustment"
msgstr "Automatsko prilagođavanje nivoa"

#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "Automatic level adjustment - changes depending on how fast you type."
msgstr "Automatsko prilagođavanje nivoa - mijenja se ovisno kako brzo kucate."

#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Enable this if you want to let KTouch adjust the levels for you "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Uključite ovo ako želite da KTouch automatski prilagođava nivo "
"za vas."

#: rc.cpp:53
msgid "Limit Down:"
msgstr "Donja granica:"

#: rc.cpp:54
msgid "Limit Up :"
msgstr "Gornja granica:"

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid "History"
msgstr "Historija"

#: rc.cpp:57
msgid "Remembers your speed and level"
msgstr "Pamti vašu brzinu i nivo"

#: rc.cpp:58
msgid ""
"Your speed and level will be recorded and brought back the next time you "
"open KTouch."
msgstr ""
"Vaša brzina i miror će biti zapisani i pozvani idući put kada otvorite "
"KTouch."

#: rc.cpp:59
msgid ""
"An option letting you choose if you want your level and speed recorded when "
"you quit."
msgstr ""
"Opcija koja vam omogućuje da izaberete da li želite da vaš nivo i brzina "
"budu zapisani kada izađete."

#: rc.cpp:60 rc.cpp:89
msgid "Form1"
msgstr "Form1"

#: rc.cpp:61
msgid ""
"The top text shows what you should write. When you press a key this "
"character will appear on the bottom line. The topline and the bottom line "
"should be equal when you are finished. At the end of the line you have to "
"press enter."
msgstr ""
"Gornji tekst prikazuje šta trebate ispisati. Kada pritisnete tipku, ovaj "
"znak će se pojaviti u donjoj liniji. Gornja linija i donja linija bi trebale "
"biti jednake. Na kraju linije trebate pritisnuti enter."

